winslot (0.2.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * The package no longer ships /etc/winslot/winslot.toml. The example is
    /usr/share/doc/winslot/winslot.toml.example; an existing config stays.
  * Site settings are no longer in the repository, apart from an example.
  * winslot-lan-dns: optional DHCP for the uplink LAN and DNS for its devices,
    with the VM zone forwarded to libvirt's dnsmasq.
  * Slots and golden images present a fixed CPU model, IvyBridge-IBRS, recorded
    in the slot's identity and license record, not the host's CPU. vm update
    pins it on an unlicensed older slot and refuses a licensed one.
  * Golden image: PowerShell 7.6.9, with its update check off.
  * Rebuilds: the installer restores LAN reservations and names from the site's
    files and stops for the host CA backup's passphrase. License records keep the
    slot's address, and vm restore reuses it.

 -- TMRA tech committee <tech@w8hhf.org>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 14:00:00 -0500

winslot (0.2.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Golden image: SumatraPDF, with its update check off. New users default
    to Firefox for web links and pages and SumatraPDF for PDFs.
  * Static addresses: each slot gets a DHCP reservation on its MAC, kept
    through decommission and recreate. "vm reserve" sets one on an existing
    slot; "vm list" shows it.

 -- TMRA tech committee <tech@w8hhf.org>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 01:30:00 -0400

winslot (0.2.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * "host console" and winslot-console.service: break-glass root password,
    SSH host key and VM host CA fingerprints on the console login prompt,
    redrawn at every boot.
  * The package installs /root/README.
  * Golden image: STIG-style sign-in (no tiles, notice, 15-minute idle
    lock), TMRA theme for new users, consumer apps and features removed.

 -- TMRA tech committee <tech@w8hhf.org>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:30:00 -0400

winslot (0.2.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * License register: "license scan" (and a six-hourly timer) records
    activated slots with their key, recovered from the VM and confirmed by
    Windows; "license record/list/show/print/release".
  * One-page PDF sheet per licensed slot with a QR code of its record;
    "vm restore" redefines a slot from that record.
  * "vm delete" for slots that were never activated; licensed slots are
    refused.
  * "vm update"; virtio video; virt-manager titles start with the slot name.
  * Golden image: windows_exporter license collector.

 -- TMRA tech committee <tech@w8hhf.org>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:00:00 -0400

winslot (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial package.

